      "side": 1,
      "message": "It\u0027s not clear to me what this means.\n\nWhen I read \"image\", I think \"on disk\", but the secret is never in the disk of the client VM, right? It\u0027s only ever in guest memory.",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 7,
