        "id": 1958315
      },
      "writtenOn": "2023-10-16T08:17:52Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Actually the secret is stored on disk. Each VM is assigned a unique \"secret\" that is randomly generated with a TRNG in pvmfw, the secret is used as hidden for the DICE main flow in pvmfw and is stored encrypted in an image on the disk.",
      "parentUuid": "37c16658_a307181b",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 7,
        "startChar": 26,
        "endLine": 7,
        "endChar": 40
      },
      "revId": "26904d90900f36421c50af564f7cff3a9fa59261",
